Recommends: gstreamer1.0-libav
Description: DRM/KMS camera wall for Raspberry Pi OS Lite
 Viewwall renders RTSP camera feeds directly onto KMS overlay planes, with no
 X11, Wayland, desktop environment, or software compositor. Each feed is
 decoded once in hardware and scanned out on its own plane, so the video path
 stays zero-copy. Built and tested against UniFi Protect, it works with any
 camera or NVR that publishes RTSP.
 .
 Python builds and supervises a native GStreamer graph and never touches video
 pixels. Feeds recover independently from RTSP loss, decoder stalls and EOS,
 and the process itself is supervised by systemd.
